                                "sense_id": "4ed7fce3-8f07-3bf5-9216-e2f84370c1ef",
                                "text": "The Navy uses several types of coffee makers – urns, silexes, and percolators. Each type requires special care in making good coffee."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77b2b325-910b-4a44-bebe-44381561099a",
                                "sense_id": "4ed7fce3-8f07-3bf5-9216-e2f84370c1ef",
                                "text": "Remembering my daily habits, Papa-san brewed the coffee and before I had completed a local phone call, he was serving it piping hot from the Silex, still grinning as he thought of other days of coffee-making."
